{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>NEN 是一款專為 iPhone 與 Apple Watch 設計的極簡風格番茄鐘應用，適合需要深度工作、學習或編程的用戶。該應用目前提供終生版內購限時免費活動，讓用戶以零成本享受原本需付費的高级功能。</p>\n\n<h2>沉浸式專注體驗</h2>\n<p>NEN 採用寧靜視覺設計，整合短休息與長休息循環，支援 Live Activities 及桌面小工具。用戶可建立不同類別的工作任務，透過清晰進度追蹤提升效率，並利用 Apple Watch 方便控制計時，打造無干擾的日常專注節奏。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-698-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-699-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-700-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-701-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-702-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-703-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<h2>限時免費領取終生版</h2>\n<p>NEN: Focus Timer 終生版內購限時免費中，用戶完成初始化後看到收費牆，Lifetime 價格顯示為$0 即可免費收下。注意，如果看到價格不是 $0 代表限免已完結，請勿按付費確認。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：NEN: Focus Timer</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-29T13:58:29.901588+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":388,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}